{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BE TINY BUT MIGHTY!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All about the charm of being a small underdog nation  punching way above it's weight class.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scratch your base building itch without the  grind of running a mega, spreadsheet empire.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GROW IDYLLIC CITIES, DEFEND  WITH CAMARADERIE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soak in the beautiful sky islands atmosphere and start cute settlements worth protecting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, defend and complete surgical missions with your hero squad to secure a foothold.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A STRATEGY GAME\u00a0&quot;COMFORT FOOD&quot; </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pickup. Highly replayable. Chill vibes but with tight, meaningful choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No  resource micro-management and army  slog, but you will be stretched to the last moment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRY IT NOW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/d01e25c95264ea014647d6c6894ac352.poster.avif?t=1759407957\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/d01e25c95264ea014647d6c6894ac352.webm?t=1759407957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/d01e25c95264ea014647d6c6894ac352.mp4?t=1759407957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgrou